<title>FRANCE: Blast hits Paris subway station.</title>
<headline>Blast hits Paris subway station.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A blast rocked a station of the regional express underground railway in central Paris on Tuesday and several people were injured, police said.</p>
<p>The explosion occurred just before 6.30 p.m. (1730 GMT) at the Port Royal RER station on the Left Bank. Police had no more details.</p>
